to-be-incorporated-into-paper-lines-90 : List (List Word)
to-be-incorporated-into-paper-lines-90 = cons "" (cons "`#input x` declares a definition without a value. An operation that needs `x`'s value (applying" (cons "it, a case on it, a projection) is held at exactly that point. Everything that does not depend on" (cons "`x` reduces fully, and the parts of a result that do not need `x` are produced. `#supply x = t`" (cons "connects the value, and the held operations proceed. Unlike a variable, an input is not computed" (cons "with symbolically: what depends on it waits for it." nil)))))
